7. MapReduce

MapReduce is a distributed processing model.

Basic architecture:

Input
  ↓
MAP
  ↓
Shuffle
  ↓
REDUCE
  ↓
Output

Example:

Input:

apple
banana
apple
apple
banana
Map
apple  → (apple, 1)
banana → (banana, 1)
apple  → (apple, 1)
Shuffle
apple  → [1,1,1]
banana → [1,1]
Reduce
apple  → 3
banana → 2
