14. RDD Actions

Actions trigger execution.

collect()
count()
take()
first()
reduce()
saveAsTextFile()
Important distinction
TRANSFORMATION
     ↓
Creates RDD
     ↓
Lazy

ACTION
     ↓
Triggers execution
     ↓
Returns result

Example:

rdd.filter(lambda x: x > 10)

Nothing is actually returned to you.

But:

rdd.filter(lambda x: x > 10).collect()

executes the operation.

15. Lazy Evaluation

One of Spark's most important concepts.

rdd \
    .filter(lambda x: x > 10) \
    .map(lambda x: x * 2)

Spark builds a plan.

It doesn't immediately execute everything.

Then:

.collect()

triggers execution.

filter()
   ↓
map()
   ↓
collect()
   ↓
EXECUTE
