36. Tungsten

Tungsten is Spark's execution/memory optimization project.

Focuses on things such as:

Memory management
CPU efficiency
Binary processing
Code generation

Simple interview answer:

Catalyst optimizes the query plan, while Tungsten focuses on efficient execution and memory/CPU utilization.

